SUMMARY:The Art of Play with Laurie Kwo
LOCATION:Bayou Arts Center\, 105 Hogtown Bayou Ln\, Santa Rosa Beach\, FL
DESCRIPTION:We all know how to paint — we just need to remember. In this 
 immersive\, five-day workshop\, you’ll rediscover the joy of creating fr
 eely while exploring layers of materials like crayon\, marker\, oil pastel
 \, collage\, and acrylic paint. Each day builds upon the last as we move f
 rom playful experimentation to thoughtful composition\, all while diving d
 eep into color\, texture\, and creative expression.…\n\nTimes\, the live
